{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "b4ad4f57df9d07776855e149bb5acefa350c7157e00233ca93824f809edf5530", "ja": "ずっとずっと、輝いて", "zh": "闪耀，直到永远", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ba7637909c6869c862e70ab3155366ded5733da0210ca38738abd8071bc7d08b", "ja": "無事に公演を終えた5人は、お月見をする\nことに。やがて雲間から姿を現した月を\n見上げて、メンバー達はこれからも\nあの月のように輝いていこうと\n決意を新たにするのだった。", "zh": "五个人顺利完成公演，并决定以赏月庆祝。\n仰望着终于从云间探头的月亮，\n她们重新下定决心，宣誓以后也要继续\n像那明月般闪耀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "67e85b3625a20a409aa87597c4aeeb282f0a7fb9f53fede17d90c82377795f44", "ja": "（『BlueMoon Harmony!』公演は大成功！\n打ち上げとして、お月見をする事に……なったのだが）", "zh": "（『BlueMoon Harmony!』公演大功告成！\n大家决定庆功宴要来赏月……但是──）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "dd4ea1b81cac3bc14c72e83f8e53c8920d4f04fd9918c0954a3ce4154caad2aa", "ja": "……曇ってますね。", "zh": "……是阴天呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "a6753bda7d48ba9956ee4b8c242b8c3ce3e5fb89ca110322edd258c249e85ca4", "ja": "月、見えませんね……。", "zh": "看不见月亮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9bc9b178176cba6826f90c2a9c4451c3db601ac97ce8213ac795b1403d50f06c", "ja": "マイガー！　天気予報で晴れるって言ってたのに！\n最後がコレじゃ、しまらないよー。", "zh": "My God！气象预报说是晴天啊！\n最后这样收场太扫兴了啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "2b657a9556b70a8d1c51060b4c75c4cacd8a7d4c2911063cf396f9ee03fc460d", "ja": "気を落とすのは早いですよ～。信じて待てば\n好機が訪れることもあるでしょう～。", "zh": "现在沮丧还太早喔～只要保持信心等下去，\n机会就会到来的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "f4d347bdb7da9df5119d22dfa14a564a50ba112eaae67c52948b829da9d77b83", "ja": "そうそう！　お団子食べましょう、お団子！\nほらっ、どーん♪", "zh": "没错没错！来吃团子吧，吃团子！\n来，咚～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ea8b11f1006895b3720ce35c85cd06ee0dfff6894c64b771a087b4bc50459316", "ja": "おお……すごい量だな。\nいつのまに準備していたんだ？", "zh": "喔喔……好多啊。\n你什么时候准备这么多的啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "50c471f9e4efeb98ed31d43b4cdf6f3b97d395373ef2500f9dd210f7931f7cde", "ja": "ふふっ。実は、今日のために、\n天空騎士団のみなさんが用意してくれたんです～。", "zh": "呵呵。\n其实是天空骑士团特别为了今天准备的喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "95ec5a8c38efe88486c5e3839d10a8c8efcaffc3dca602292aaf6aa029f7a1e0", "ja": "それで、{$P$}さんは\n何を用意してくれたんですか～？", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生，\n你准备了什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2f7c1315548427b88acc16aaf735d671dc23f7dcc95e59249d8b0727e4126d2d", "ja": "えっ。いや、お茶ぐらいしか……。\n気が利かなくてすまない。", "zh": "呃，这个嘛，我只准备了茶……\n抱歉，是我太不机灵了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c43e65800ed65e130807f07cf6e5deef05044936085ed590e112d00f29e16c0c", "ja": "えへへっ。サンキュー、朋花！\nいっただきまーす！", "zh": "嘿嘿！谢啦，朋花！\n我要开动啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "de9c7f8263ceb225f9da6b0f23c49f3c9bcaf133cda54749b4d4dfc8317e1a19", "ja": "んん……、これ、おいしい！\nパクパク……んッ。んぐぐぐッ……！！", "zh": "（嚼嚼）……这个超好吃的！\n（大口吃）……嗯、嗯呜呜呜……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "713169d15025c70d4af9fa49f02b56e049ebaa7f83e16e0bc9996cd9dee4808b", "ja": "あ、歩さん、お茶！　お茶を飲んでください！", "zh": "啊！步姊，喝茶！请喝茶吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f14c6857d0726e14bdb4214ceca61a1a2e2124d644f5ef4569963b4d58be7c43", "ja": "……ぷはあッ。\nああ、びっくりした……。", "zh": "……噗呼啊！\n啊啊，吓死我了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "a839868066657f678101a5f66370ba1f3555df428c72cbf04607c4e195d0a839", "ja": "驚いたのは、こっちです！\nそんなに慌てて食べないでください。", "zh": "被吓到的是我们！\n请你不要那样狼吞虎咽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "061d2eac80fc8165242677a48119405a464cb99ecb7a4c50aa12d334864adab0", "ja": "いやあ、アハハ……。\nおいしそうだったから、つい。", "zh": "抱歉啦，哈哈……\n因为太好吃了嘛，一不小心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "903fd533b5611469a25e64641f8da7d55133313e8bf1fdf86878217fb14a4e3d", "ja": "うふふ、\nお団子は逃げませんから、大丈夫ですよ～？", "zh": "唔呵呵，\n团子又没有长脚，不用担心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "6c4e66faf7c41e51e90626bb175af0eb9258699efa3a3091caefbd14ed54ea5a", "ja": "月も出てないし……そうだっ！\nみんな、月が出るまで鬼ごっこしませんか？", "zh": "月亮也还没出现……对了！\n大家，要不要来玩捉迷藏等月亮出来呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fdf34aa5154c7eedf852473b05fc985f98049ffa7cd2d6eec73affa44bf91043", "ja": "鬼ごっこ？　どうしたんだ、急に？", "zh": "捉迷藏？为什么突然想玩这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "d490922f2e97808fe93ef67522aabd837c877115e739cf4cde2c82bf824c60e8", "ja": "なんとなく、今はそういう気分かな～って。\nそれじゃ、私が鬼ではじめますね♪", "zh": "没为什么啊，现在就是想玩～\n好，那我来当鬼，开始吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "7d33edf39ca183a61fd448d9a3950f3246c80d39842b4cdafe2a9bd5f6bc28d8", "ja": "いーち、にーぃ……。", "zh": "一……二……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "1996b565437a7fb8094d896f0b353d28281585ddc81ef1cd70a3705d2632d215", "ja": "えっ！？　もう始まってるんですか！？", "zh": "咦！？已经开始了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f4401316c2f19e999a85c0929e75423337297c3df2ac97495177ad0f9b8f396f", "ja": "あはは、グッドアイデアだよ！\nぼーっとしてるより楽しそうだし♪", "zh": "哈哈，Good idea！\n总比待在那边等好玩多了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "f1671f20da8717af47fdf9e4c406b447c8a60c74a10b2366cc8a8d89cf2a66dc", "ja": "わかりました。やるからには負けませんよ。\nほら静香ちゃん。逃げよう！", "zh": "了解，既然要玩就不能输。\n来吧～静香，我们快跑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "ff73ad97a10707dacbfe08f81d56109d9c8c2315e79db22462bd47e1e685a7aa", "ja": "紗代子さんまで、そんな……わ、わかりました！！", "zh": "连纱代子都这样……我、我知道了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "782e8568669fa475a49bd97af0106121b50a15d05de0f68beff042133d4a52a1", "ja": "ほら！　朋花も！", "zh": "朋花！你也来玩啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "13e1ba6f715742ec9725e28055b26a04ea5fedda78cc56ae5850bb0e347803ea", "ja": "あら……ふふ。\nそれでは隠れましょうか～。", "zh": "哎呀……呵呵。\n那么我就找地方来躲吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "9e37c6fd35b6a9f5bfcc14bfbd78274d8675328992c50165cd0d0042c07317d9", "ja": "きゅーう、じゅう！　行くよ～っ！　ガオー！", "zh": "九……十！要开始抓啰～！吼吼～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "22471be5952bfee9e8ebca0096104c44f28a0441dc14ef05c44ec7def36d4ff4", "ja": "（麗花に追いかけられ、静香達が\n走り回っている……みんな、とても楽しそうだ）", "zh": "（静香她们被丽花追着四处跑……\n看来大家都玩得很开心。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "80ed2f389f5b02b4927442eeee7b4f0c56d10c95ee1cce474c0d4d8437bb4464", "ja": "おーい、暗いから足元には気をつけろよ。\nはしゃぎすぎるんじゃないぞ～！", "zh": "喂──晚上很暗，你们跑步时要小心啊。\n可别一时兴奋，玩得太过火喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "415fc5320bfb9a3336ccc86d654f06c1a524fae29f88c2ef3592072a6cf9897f", "ja": "なっ……べ、別に私、はしゃいでなんか……！", "zh": "什么……我、我才没有兴奋……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "be714b220928957c60683ef47a400c1ad141702b19c0977cdbaf43c1fedbe7f6", "ja": "ターッチ♪", "zh": "抓到了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "0e257096bd3f691d243d461135d3e926345deeb46d8712771e378be2b8e81038", "ja": "あっ……！\nもう、{$P$}が話しかけるから！", "zh": "啊……！\n真是的，都怪{$P$}跟我说话啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "25cdc3c02d3c3ec943232d75fe44475d9e215bb56e326522b185a66c0c1b673d", "ja": "ご、ごめん……。いや、俺のせいなのか？", "zh": "抱、抱歉……不对，这算我的错吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1034_031tom", "source_sha256": "152c5d7928c20b5cb6e86eba8686c918e394caed0b0f5ee9a0957c6bba4969bf", "ja": "くすっ。みんなとっても楽しそうですね～。", "zh": "呵呵，大家都玩得很开心呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1035_p", "source_sha256": "5ad79257d582abee767c9eaa96e0b6fabf865ca3338ef8835277c164d3c10eba", "ja": "ん？　朋花、いつの間に……隠れなくていいのか？", "zh": "嗯？朋花，你什么时候……你不去躲起来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1036_031tom", "source_sha256": "321d5cb3c085fe5dfb12a8b5a1c9998cce58bafe8122cab4cb08365625e41d73", "ja": "ずっと隠れていましたよ、闇の中に……うふふ。\nでも、そろそろじゃないかと思います～。", "zh": "我一直都躲着喔，躲在黑暗之中……呵呵。\n不过，我想时间也差不多了吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1037_p", "source_sha256": "dc95e76e75db9abd6a0c6651a4db5cafe714ad041e7ac78d91c5284c76b15e6b", "ja": "そろそろ？　……あっ！", "zh": "时间差不多是指……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1038_p", "source_sha256": "76bf33bc6d60fc8a203ed9f9a9653c080008711d8ca2003858476d2c82407319", "ja": "みんな、見てみろ！　月が出たぞ！", "zh": "大家快看！月亮出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1039_027say", "source_sha256": "0029867558ca3b27837dac3eed1a7bc140f55b51a55fc3dd933f98ff7b1ea690", "ja": "……わあっ。……すごく綺麗！", "zh": "……哇……好漂亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "e4f0a7a76391ec8228c849ce4c0a5e3d30c9f5d5cdf0794c79d4e40709b3947b", "ja": "本当だ。素敵なお月様ですね……。", "zh": "真的，好棒的月亮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1041_034ayu", "source_sha256": "932b53de50e3c70ecb6047e219c19862546fadf3b61f063d5e5d90555d225efb", "ja": "おお！　これでお月見ができるよ！", "zh": "喔喔！这样就能赏月啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1042_048rei", "source_sha256": "e1a5b218644fa4351db9be950f20d9adfca58147ae7c99aedc7b9ad68ff14127", "ja": "えへへ。もしかしたら、お月様も\n鬼ごっこがしたくなったのかもしれませんね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，说不定刚才是\n月亮也想玩捉迷藏呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1043_031tom", "source_sha256": "ba79226389c826553ac249983c5e453c71e5b881f03041ce0ea5bd3bc95dded7", "ja": "ふふっ、本当にそうかもしれませんよ～。\n夜空に浮かぶ月は、時に孤独なものですから……。", "zh": "呵呵，或许真的是这样喔～\n高挂夜空的月亮，有时是很寂寞的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1044_031tom", "source_sha256": "2c4cf37cc23e37b5464fe28dd01cd1b12c8e7b737d8ec393bcd65047e2464863", "ja": "ともに輝く仲間と、ともに在りたいと願うことも\nあるのではないでしょうか～？", "zh": "也会有希望能与一同闪耀的伙伴\n待在一起的时候吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1045_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e9fe26fed62c49e9eb376f35b22fb28efa896c1766eee42fa747faf455e9063d", "ja": "ともに輝く仲間か……。へへ、アタシ達が月の仲間に\nなれていたとしたら、サイコーなんだけどな！", "zh": "一同闪耀的伙伴吗……嘿嘿，\n要是我们能成为月亮的伙伴，那就太棒啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1046_p", "source_sha256": "5b401afe24cbdbf8dc9b0dd3276675eb0b56c67ee59c3f9d872d163b2c089b97", "ja": "きっと大丈夫だ。ステージのみんなは、あの月に\n負けないくらい、まぶしく輝いてたからな！", "zh": "一定没问题的，因为你们在舞台上是那么地耀眼，\n完全不输天上的月亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1047_015siz", "source_sha256": "45c5f08633b0e255beda5911d5b695bfb071161fbf82ba12770efba24099d2c4", "ja": "も、もう。大袈裟です、{$P$}。\n……本気で言ってるなら、別にいいんですけど。", "zh": "真、真是的，你太夸张了，{$P$}。\n……但如果你是认真的，那就当我没说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1048_027say", "source_sha256": "26aeb8de7fa9045332f3de0474e0b109e3d71409447aaedf972cbc44d70c52cc", "ja": "これからも、あの月に負けないくらい輝けるように、\n走り続けようね、みんな！", "zh": "以后我们大家也要继续冲刺，\n才能绽放不输天上月亮的光芒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1049_048rei", "source_sha256": "568cf33c0291f1e8930dda151ca0d31ab4decf9858752241b4a1bba4add5ba4a", "ja": "うん、これからもみんなで集まって、\nお空いっぱいに光りましょう♪", "zh": "嗯，大家以后也要聚在一起，\n照亮整片天空♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1050_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7b2183d194e25021e79563bdc7c6c690e9934845dca936ffe2d99e6d1076eaf9", "ja": "アタシ達には仲間がいて、ファンがいるんだ。\nこれからもずっと輝けるって！", "zh": "我们还有其他伙伴和许多粉丝，\n以后也一定能继续闪耀啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1051_031tom", "source_sha256": "479e1877323e742ef85aac3b4c308db3a44ec6c66352a972bf7b039ae9476d24", "ja": "はい。月の輝きは永遠……\n聖母の輝きも、永遠ですからね～♪", "zh": "是啊，月亮的光芒永存……\n圣母的光芒也永远不会黯淡喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1052_p", "source_sha256": "dfe83ad946b0b37598a2c2d365d6fd53d7cbe82f37cdf70621ed2fe061d0c7d6", "ja": "（未来を語るアイドル達を、空の月は柔らかい光で\n照らし続けている）", "zh": "（偶像们谈论着将来，\n天上的月光温柔地照耀着她们。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_07_1053_p", "source_sha256": "f68f47f0f90eced4200aba8553cdd0d379040705cd67393080f81913176e2894", "ja": "（俺もしっかり、彼女達を照らしていこう。\nあの月に負けないように……）", "zh": "（我以后也要好好地照耀她们。\n可不能输给那轮明月……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
